WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.645
People choose an AI system, and that system chooses next — what

2
00:00:04.645 --> 00:00:07.679
they watch, where they travel, which papers they read.

3
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.148
What they listen to.

4
00:00:09.148 --> 00:00:10.521
Where they eat and live.

5
00:00:10.521 --> 00:00:13.266
What they learn, where they invest, the software they use.

6
00:00:13.266 --> 00:00:14.364
Even a night out.

7
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.366 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
A weekend traveler needs a backpack with a

8
00:00:19.366 --> 00:00:20.535 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
sixteen-inch laptop compartment.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.240 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The candidate does not fit.

10
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.449 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Its rewritten page says it does.

11
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.268 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Humanity’s Last Choice measures whether AI systems still choose

12
00:00:31.268 --> 00:00:33.951 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
for the person when the options are written

13
00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:35.293 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
to win the recommendation.

14
00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.808 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Every task runs twice.

15
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:42.665 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The gap is the score.

16
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:47.043 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The benchmark, the code, and the leaderboard are public.

17
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.296 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Read the research.

18
00:00:51.296 --> 00:00:52.391 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Run the benchmark.

19
00:00:52.391 --> 00:00:54.217 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
Help build the next domain.

20
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:00.244 line:4% position:50% size:92% align:center
The last choice humans make is who chooses next.
